    },
    "voice": "produce_events/102400503/1024005030030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "販売員",
    "text": "えーっ、そうなんですか？\r\nすごーい！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1024005030040,
    "speaker": "にちか",
    "text": "いや、まだ────",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "nichika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102400503/1024005030040"
  },
  {
    "id": 1024005030050,
    "speaker": "にちか",
    "text": "……研修生なので！",
    "charAnim1": "surp3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "nichika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102400503/1024005030050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "販売員",
    "text": "それでもすごくないですか？\r\n私、芸能人の方の接客とか、したことないですよー",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1024005030060,
    "speaker": "にちか",
    "text": "いや……でも、全然普通で大丈夫です！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "nichika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102400503/1024005030060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "販売員",
    "text": "わかりました……！\r\n──えっと、ランニングシューズをお探しなんですよね？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "販売員",
    "text": "それでしたら……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "nichika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "販売員",
    "text": "こちらとか、いかがですか？\r\n昨日入ったばっかりなんですよー",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "se": "0220"
  },
  {
    "id": 1024005030070,
    "speaker": "にちか",
    "text": "どうもです……！\r\n履いてみてもいいです？",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "nichika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102400503/1024005030070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "販売員",
    "text": "どうぞどうぞ\r\n是非、履いてみてください！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "販売員",
    "text": "他にもいろいろ可愛いのあるので、\r\nちょっとおすすめしてもいいですか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
